; AmiWeather ABBS 3.3 Shell door launcher
; Install under ABBS:Doors/AmiWeather and reference this fixed path from
; Node0Config/NodeXConfig. C:get values are documented ABBS local variables.
C:get FullName
C:get NodeNr
ABBS:Doors/AmiWeather/AmiWeatherDoor --abbs-user "`get FullName`" --abbs-node "`get NodeNr`"
EndCLI
